    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/90672a519c7c7407e07d923ec03085e9.avif?t=1748730091\" width=569 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When Madeline, a girl with an incurable disease, vanishes without a trace, the quiet town of Pinefall is changed forever. Detective Jodie investigated the case without success, and over time, the search was abandoned. But four years later, an unexpected clue leads her to Ravenwood Hotel, a place shrouded in secrets where something\u2014or someone\u2014seems to be waiting.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Within its walls, mysteries multiply, and the hunt begins. Because at Ravenwood, there is a special guest whose interest in Jodie is as lethal as it is unknown.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/5f67e92592995eb443a25316563b5e14.avif?t=1748730091\" width=569 height=76 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environments:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ravenwood Hotel isn\u2019t your average building. It packs more amenities than you\u2019d expect\u2014a bar, meeting rooms, a library... and even a hidden speakeasy. Plus, explore forests, gardens, sewers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way by solving brainteasers that will truly test your wits. Hidden keys, locked mechanisms, and cryptic messages are just waiting to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/d3ae2ed278d937eb15646753e4ee00b9.poster.avif?t=1748730091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/d3ae2ed278d937eb15646753e4ee00b9.webm?t=1748730091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Classic Inventory:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a limited selection of items, combine them, and solve puzzles right from your inventory. Choose wisely what you carry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side Missions:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deeper than the main story to uncover hidden secrets. Some rewards might give you an edge in combat, like special accessories or upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/373cbca762f5e535f77c33c171173e64.poster.avif?t=1748730091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/373cbca762f5e535f77c33c171173e64.webm?t=1748730091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures that shouldn\u2019t exist lurk in the shadows of the hotel. Every encounter could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/648ba12066f8917cba7511c9301bf1c0.poster.avif?t=1748730091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/648ba12066f8917cba7511c9301bf1c0.webm?t=1748730091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all horrors in the hotel are simple threats. Some are out for you\u2014and they won\u2019t stop until you\u2019re down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you uncover the whole truth behind Madeline\u2019s case? Or will Ravenwood Hotel bury its secrets along with you? <strong>Just remember: you\u2019re not alone.</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/90672a519c7c7407e07d923ec03085e9.avif?t=1748730091\" width=569 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When Madeline, a girl with an incurable disease, vanishes without a trace, the quiet town of Pinefall is changed forever. Detective Jodie investigated the case without success, and over time, the search was abandoned. But four years later, an unexpected clue leads her to Ravenwood Hotel, a place shrouded in secrets where something\u2014or someone\u2014seems to be waiting.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Within its walls, mysteries multiply, and the hunt begins. Because at Ravenwood, there is a special guest whose interest in Jodie is as lethal as it is unknown.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/5f67e92592995eb443a25316563b5e14.avif?t=1748730091\" width=569 height=76 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environments:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ravenwood Hotel isn\u2019t your average building. It packs more amenities than you\u2019d expect\u2014a bar, meeting rooms, a library... and even a hidden speakeasy. Plus, explore forests, gardens, sewers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way by solving brainteasers that will truly test your wits. Hidden keys, locked mechanisms, and cryptic messages are just waiting to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/d3ae2ed278d937eb15646753e4ee00b9.poster.avif?t=1748730091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/d3ae2ed278d937eb15646753e4ee00b9.webm?t=1748730091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Classic Inventory:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a limited selection of items, combine them, and solve puzzles right from your inventory. Choose wisely what you carry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side Missions:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deeper than the main story to uncover hidden secrets. Some rewards might give you an edge in combat, like special accessories or upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/373cbca762f5e535f77c33c171173e64.poster.avif?t=1748730091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/373cbca762f5e535f77c33c171173e64.webm?t=1748730091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures that shouldn\u2019t exist lurk in the shadows of the hotel. Every encounter could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/648ba12066f8917cba7511c9301bf1c0.poster.avif?t=1748730091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497410/extras/648ba12066f8917cba7511c9301bf1c0.webm?t=1748730091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all horrors in the hotel are simple threats. Some are out for you\u2014and they won\u2019t stop until you\u2019re down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you uncover the whole truth behind Madeline\u2019s case? Or will Ravenwood Hotel bury its secrets along with you? <strong>Just remember: you\u2019re not alone.</strong></i></p>",
    "short_description": "Detective Jodie follows the trail of Madeline to the enigmatic Ravenwood Hotel, a place full of secrets. Solve puzzles, manage a classic inventory, and face deadly enemies and bosses. Explore side missions to gain combat advantages. Every corner brings you closer to the truth.",
